sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Payer as Customer or Agent
    participant PayLink
    participant Wallet as Wallet and Ledger
    participant Biller
    participant Notifications

    Payer->>PayLink: Submit payment details and idempotency key
    PayLink->>PayLink: Check idempotency key

    alt Same key and matching details
        PayLink-->>Payer: Return existing payment status
    else Same key and different details
        PayLink-->>Payer: Reject conflicting request
    else New request
        PayLink->>PayLink: Create payment as Initiated
        PayLink->>PayLink: Calculate fee and total
        PayLink->>PayLink: Validate details, account, limits and velocity

        alt Validation fails
            PayLink->>PayLink: Set Rejected
            PayLink-->>Payer: Return rejection reason
        else Validation passes
            PayLink->>Wallet: Hold total from payer wallet

            Note over Payer,Wallet: Agent payments use the Agent wallet.

            alt Insufficient available funds
                Wallet-->>PayLink: Hold refused
                PayLink->>PayLink: Set Rejected
                PayLink-->>Payer: Return insufficient funds
            else Funds held
                Wallet->>Wallet: Record hold in immutable ledger and audit
                Wallet-->>PayLink: Hold confirmed
                PayLink->>PayLink: Set FundsHeld
                PayLink->>PayLink: Set SentToBiller
                PayLink->>Biller: Send bill amount and unique reference

                alt Success confirmed
                    Biller-->>PayLink: Success

                    critical Settle funds, credit commission and mark Completed atomically and exactly once
                        PayLink->>Wallet: Charge held total and credit eligible Agent commission
                        Wallet->>Wallet: Record movements in ledger and audit
                        Wallet-->>PayLink: Settlement confirmed
                        PayLink->>PayLink: Set Completed
                    end

                    Note over PayLink,Wallet: Agent commission equals 40 percent of the service fee.

                    PayLink->>Notifications: Send Customer completion SMS and push
                    PayLink-->>Payer: Return Completed

                else Failure confirmed
                    Biller-->>PayLink: Failure and reason
                    PayLink->>PayLink: Set Failed
                    PayLink->>Notifications: Send Customer failure SMS and push
                    PayLink->>PayLink: Start refund flow
                    PayLink-->>Payer: Return failure reason and current status

                else TopUpNet returns accepted
                    Biller-->>PayLink: Accepted
                    PayLink-->>Payer: Return processing status
                    Note over PayLink,Biller: Stay SentToBiller with funds held while awaiting final callback.

                else No initial response within 10 seconds
                    PayLink->>PayLink: Set Unknown
                    PayLink-->>Payer: Return processing status
                    Note over PayLink,Biller: Keep funds held and query the original payment reference.
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over PayLink,Notifications: Notification failure does not reverse payment or change balances.